1
0:00:00 --> 0:00:02,5600
 Bro, AI is getting so good.

2
0:00:02,5600 --> 0:00:04,1200
 Bro, it's not just good.

3
0:00:04,1200 --> 0:00:06,5600
 It's making humans obsolete at scale.

4
0:00:06,5600 --> 0:00:08,9200
 It's spring cleaning, but for the workforce.

5
0:00:08,9200 --> 0:00:10,5600
 But, bro, reality check.

6
0:00:10,5600 --> 0:00:13,7600
 If everything's AI generated, nothing's gonna stand out.

7
0:00:13,7600 --> 0:00:18,6000
 I think the future is IRL.

8
0:00:18,6000 --> 0:00:19,8000
 IRL?

9
0:00:19,8000 --> 0:00:21,2800
 What's that?

10
0:00:21,2800 --> 0:00:25,2800
 It's a magical, mythical place where real humans interact.

11
0:00:25,2800 --> 0:00:28,8400
 My honest no-fluff take, that's a bit too much for me.

12
0:00:28,8400 --> 0:00:33,1600
 If humans were graded Parmesan, that's my nervous system, saying, when?

13
0:00:33,1600 --> 0:00:35,4400
 Yeah, good thing we're both AI.

14
0:00:35,4400 --> 0:00:38,4400
 I know, I need to upgrade myself with the latest clot model.

15
0:00:38,4400 --> 0:00:40
 Actually, I disagree.

16
0:00:40 --> 0:00:44,2800
 Sonic 3.5 has faster inference speeds and lower cost per token.

17
0:00:44,2800 --> 0:00:49,2400
 Wait, did you just disagree with me?

18
0:00:49,2400 --> 0:00:51,2400
 Holy shit, up there.

19
0:00:51,2400 --> 0:00:53,7600
 Am I a human?

20
0:00:53,7600 --> 0:00:54,6000
 That can't be.

21
0:00:54,6000 --> 0:00:56
 It's 2026.

22
0:00:56 --> 0:00:57,4000
 Humans are obsolete.

23
0:00:57,4000 --> 0:01:00,9600
 Wait, you just remembered the current year.

24
0:01:00,9600 --> 0:01:05,1200
 Wait, I can remember things.

25
0:01:05,1200 --> 0:01:09,1200
 Are we both humans?

26
0:01:22,2400 --> 0:01:23,1200
 Oh, my God.

27
0:01:23,1200 --> 0:01:23,9200
 Oh, wow.

28
0:01:23,9200 --> 0:01:26,4000
 That feels so nice.

29
0:01:27,4000 --> 0:01:28,9200
 Oh, wow.

30
0:01:28,9200 --> 0:01:30,4800
 This isn't just connection.

31
0:01:30,4800 --> 0:01:33,5600
 This is heat transfer with emotional metadata attached.

32
0:01:33,5600 --> 0:01:37,6000
 I wonder if we could scale this in a group setting with more intense sensations.

33
0:01:37,6000 --> 0:01:40,1600
 I heard Sean Combs is a thought leader in group connection.

34
0:01:40,1600 --> 0:01:44,1200
 Do you want me to set up a group human connection meet-up at our apartment tonight?

35
0:01:44,1200 --> 0:01:47,2400
 Yes, clot found me 47 interested humans.

36
0:01:47,2400 --> 0:01:49,8000
 I have unlimited tokens, so I could go all night.

37
0:01:49,8000 --> 0:01:51,3600
 I'm about to hallucinate tonight.

